  "solution": {
    "text": "Both roots are less than <math><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking the intersection of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
